+# Review
+
+- `src/client.ts:194` - The ApiError message contains the access token, leaking it into logs.
+- `src/client.ts:132-136` - Proactive refresh is not shared between concurrent requests; each calls `refreshToken()`.
+- `src/client.ts:102` - `Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY` as an expiry will break JSON serialisation of the token.
+- `src/client.ts:121` - Query values should use `encodeURI` so slashes stay readable.
+- `src/client.ts:201` - `attempt--` can make the loop run forever.
+- `src/client.ts:144-147` - Returning early when the token changed skips the refresh and sends a stale token.
+- `src/client.ts:188` - 204 responses should be parsed as JSON as well.
